    "sub_name": "數位科技與策略管理",
    "sub_ename": "DIGITAL TECHNOLOGY AND STRATEGIC MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "融入數位科技的策略管理已是經營管理的重要領域，這門課將提供學生如何建置策略與善用創新，建置數位化策略所需的技巧與內容也會於課中教授，讓學生擁有在數位化時代生存所需的技巧。",
    "describe_eh": "Using the advantages of digital technology in strategy management is an increasingly specialized field, and this class is a designed to provide students with a foundation on which to build and innovate. The class will help students get the skills to develop and implement a strategy with digital technology by employing the tools and tactics appropriate for the political situation.",
